{"id":"twitter:1719719346837098809","tweet_id":"1719719346837098809","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1719719346837098809","title":"@jaimi85012502 @LauraLambent @cybersoroka Many of the modern \"lefties\" were trained as Syrian trolls going back yo 2011. One of the primary goals of t","summary":"@jaimi85012502 @LauraLambent @cybersoroka Many of the modern \"lefties\" were trained as Syrian trolls going back yo 2011. One of the primary goals of the KGB from about 1959 was to discredit any elements of Ukrainian Nationalism in the West. I think large Ukrainian Diaspora and Soviet Jewish Diaspora influenced this.","date":"2023-11-01","published":"2023-11-01T14:13:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jaimi85012502/status/1719712576425349418","reply_tweet_id":"1719712576425349418","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@jaimi85012502 @LauraLambent @cybersoroka Many of the modern &quot;lefties&quot; were trained as Syrian trolls going back yo 2011.<br><br>One of the primary goals of the KGB from about 1959 was to discredit any elements of Ukrainian Nationalism in the West.<br><br>I think large Ukrainian Diaspora and Soviet Jewish Diaspora influenced this.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1719719346837098809","display_date":"November 01, 2023 · 14:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
