{"id":"twitter:1719523451742962014","tweet_id":"1719523451742962014","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1719523451742962014","title":"@DrAmarRN @libbyemmons @elonmusk You don't have free speech on private property, silly. It is a contractual relationship. Free speech is a relationshi","summary":"@DrAmarRN @libbyemmons @elonmusk You don't have free speech on private property, silly. It is a contractual relationship. Free speech is a relationship with the government not a corporation.","date":"2023-11-01","published":"2023-11-01T01:15:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DrAmarRN/status/1719452214966604206","reply_tweet_id":"1719452214966604206","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DrAmarRN @libbyemmons @elonmusk You don&#x27;t have free speech on private property, silly.<br><br>It is a contractual relationship.<br><br>Free speech is a relationship with the government not a corporation.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1719523451742962014","display_date":"November 01, 2023 · 01:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
