{"id":"twitter:1719360378788843747","tweet_id":"1719360378788843747","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1719360378788843747","title":"After his travels with the Russian National Mutual Aid Society Hausiak would settle back in America He became active in the Communist Party USA, ultim","summary":"After his travels with the Russian National Mutual Aid Society Hausiak would settle back in America He became active in the Communist Party USA, ultimately serving on the party’s national committee, its national groups commission, and the New York party’s state committee. https://t.co/ssSDK2n7SO","date":"2023-10-31","published":"2023-10-31T14:27:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1719359717762277752","reply_tweet_id":"1719359717762277752","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>After his travels with the Russian National Mutual Aid Society Hausiak would settle back in America<br><br>He became active in the Communist Party USA, ultimately serving on the party’s national  committee, its national groups commission, and the New York party’s  state committee. <a href=\"https://t.co/ssSDK2n7SO\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ssSDK2n7SO</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a89101b1b4c3b1895654ed0b4e1f1670.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1719360378788843747","display_date":"October 31, 2023 · 14:27 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a89101b1b4c3b1895654ed0b4e1f1670.jpg"]}
