{"id":"twitter:1717345684150435960","tweet_id":"1717345684150435960","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1717345684150435960","title":"My heart breaks for Lewiston. Not again Survivors in network as always DM. Check in on others. Phone calls save lives. It's okay to not be okay Wait f","summary":"My heart breaks for Lewiston. Not again Survivors in network as always DM. Check in on others. Phone calls save lives. It's okay to not be okay Wait for news. Gun debate and trolls will flare. Don't doom scroll Will add office hours tomorrow for any students who need to talk","date":"2023-10-26","published":"2023-10-26T01:01:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>My heart breaks for Lewiston.<br><br>Not again<br><br>Survivors in network as always DM.<br><br>Check in on others. Phone calls save lives. It&#x27;s okay to not be okay<br><br>Wait for news. Gun debate and trolls will flare. Don&#x27;t doom scroll<br><br>Will add office hours tomorrow for any students who need to talk</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1717345684150435960","display_date":"October 26, 2023 · 01:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1717321490670981473","tweet_id":"1717321490670981473","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1717321490670981473","title":"@StratoAngst My friends who write and produce creative commons content pay a small fee to commercial companies. If a commercial company uses the conte","summary":"@StratoAngst My friends who write and produce creative commons content pay a small fee to commercial companies. If a commercial company uses the content they get a lawyer letter saying $500.00 license fee or we sue. Lawyer gets half. They donate other half, but don't need to.","date":"2023-10-25","published":"2023-10-25T23:25:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/StratoAngst/status/1717287755212812786","reply_tweet_id":"1717287755212812786","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@StratoAngst My friends who write and produce creative commons content pay a small fee to commercial companies.<br><br>If a commercial company uses the content they get a lawyer letter saying $500.00 license fee or we sue.<br><br>Lawyer gets half. They donate other half, but don&#x27;t need to.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1717321490670981473","display_date":"October 25, 2023 · 23:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
