{"id":"twitter:1717234560990351452","tweet_id":"1717234560990351452","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1717234560990351452","title":"You need to understand why they call it \"Science of Reading\" It is so they can call you racist for not supporting science and allowing Brown and Black","summary":"You need to understand why they call it \"Science of Reading\" It is so they can call you racist for not supporting science and allowing Brown and Black kids to fail If you read the foot notes and technical reports of the NRP... a lot of science was left out #literacies https://t.co/Ox81OqeAqd","date":"2023-10-25","published":"2023-10-25T17:39:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["literacies"],"body_html":"<p>You need to understand why they call it &quot;Science of Reading&quot;<br><br>It is so they can call you racist for not supporting science and allowing Brown and Black kids to fail<br><br>If you read the foot notes and technical reports of the NRP... a lot of science was left out<br><br>#literacies <a href=\"https://t.co/Ox81OqeAqd\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Ox81OqeAqd</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/597e0305f2d5f8327b924992c2c032fe.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1717234560990351452","display_date":"October 25, 2023 · 17:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/597e0305f2d5f8327b924992c2c032fe.png"]}
