{"id":"twitter:1717172000580317403","tweet_id":"1717172000580317403","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1717172000580317403","title":"California has an economy larger than almost every nation in the world. Don't know where they rank in Chinese trade but it has to be in top ten. Clima","summary":"California has an economy larger than almost every nation in the world. Don't know where they rank in Chinese trade but it has to be in top ten. Climate crisis and it's effect on Pacific Rim security is a problem the US and China have to tackle together. Too late to prevent https://x.com/APompliano/status/1717170713335824655","date":"2023-10-25","published":"2023-10-25T13:31:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>California has an economy larger than almost every nation in the world.<br><br>Don&#x27;t know where they rank in Chinese trade but it has to be in top ten.<br><br>Climate crisis and it&#x27;s effect on Pacific Rim security is a problem the US and China have to tackle together.<br><br>Too late to prevent <a href=\"https://x.com/APompliano/status/1717170713335824655\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/APompliano/status/1717170713335824655</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1717172000580317403","display_date":"October 25, 2023 · 13:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
