{"id":"twitter:1716967634816647470","tweet_id":"1716967634816647470","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1716967634816647470","title":"@TheGeneral1863 @gaysatanabyss @Chairman_Meowed @HuntinatorThe @RICHARD71287151 @WhiteSoxic @Junglethc420 @fellaraktar @BamaMarineMsgt @mister_hooper ","summary":"@TheGeneral1863 @gaysatanabyss @Chairman_Meowed @HuntinatorThe @RICHARD71287151 @WhiteSoxic @Junglethc420 @fellaraktar @BamaMarineMsgt @mister_hooper @Hydrotactical @NC_WASP @anti_ball Dr. Ron says the Southern Avenger wrote those newsletters. Rand admits Jack Butler wrote \"Tea Party Goes to Washington\" Quoting Ron and Rand doesn't help your argument, Ivan. ","date":"2023-10-24","published":"2023-10-24T23:59:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheGeneral1863/status/1716966392564519272","reply_tweet_id":"1716966392564519272","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TheGeneral1863 @gaysatanabyss @Chairman_Meowed @HuntinatorThe @RICHARD71287151 @WhiteSoxic @Junglethc420 @fellaraktar @BamaMarineMsgt @mister_hooper @Hydrotactical @NC_WASP @anti_ball Dr. Ron says the Southern Avenger wrote those newsletters.<br><br>Rand admits Jack Butler wrote &quot;Tea Party Goes to Washington&quot;<br><br>Quoting Ron and Rand doesn&#x27;t help your argument, Ivan.<br><br>But I am zoinking that meme to mess with Libertarian chuds <a href=\"https://t.co/kwj4nsTrNG\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/kwj4nsTrNG</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/30b8eec678466fabfb57d0b8184503f5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1716967634816647470","display_date":"October 24, 2023 · 23:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/30b8eec678466fabfb57d0b8184503f5.jpg"]}
