{"id":"twitter:2082831726875754543","tweet_id":"2082831726875754543","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2082831726875754543","title":"@serhii_rieznik I have been doing balsawood to keep it cheap, but may switch to basswood. Balsawood is really soft, and easy to burn, but basswood so ","summary":"@serhii_rieznik I have been doing balsawood to keep it cheap, but may switch to basswood. Balsawood is really soft, and easy to burn, but basswood so much richer and you can get more shades. More expensive to ship. I can to the balsawood as First Class Mail and card stock.","date":"2026-07-30","published":"2026-07-30T14:12:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/serhii_rieznik/status/2082830783635443941","reply_tweet_id":"2082830783635443941","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@serhii_rieznik I have been doing balsawood to keep it cheap, but may switch to basswood.<br><br>Balsawood is really soft, and easy to burn, but basswood so much richer and you can get more shades.<br><br>More expensive to ship. I can to the balsawood as First Class Mail and card stock.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2082831726875754543","display_date":"July 30, 2026 · 14:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2082830932763943052","tweet_id":"2082830932763943052","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2082830932763943052","title":"@serhii_rieznik A year ago trying to figure out some way to help. Carve too, but the time it takes and my skill level wouldn't justify the amount that","summary":"@serhii_rieznik A year ago trying to figure out some way to help. Carve too, but the time it takes and my skill level wouldn't justify the amount that can be raised. These little wood burnings I can do at 25-50 and people like them. Shipping is problematic. Both my personality and US Postal https://t.co/QkW50xDIcd","date":"2026-07-30","published":"2026-07-30T14:09:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2082829820501672345","reply_tweet_id":"2082829820501672345","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@serhii_rieznik A year ago trying to figure out some way to help.<br><br>Carve too, but the time it takes and my skill level wouldn&#x27;t justify the amount that can be raised.<br><br>These little wood burnings I can do at 25-50 and people like them.<br><br>Shipping is problematic. Both my personality and US Postal <a href=\"https://t.co/QkW50xDIcd\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/QkW50xDIcd</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/22a99b1fd1bc6b740f5dc1dcfac703ad.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2082830932763943052","display_date":"July 30, 2026 · 14:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/22a99b1fd1bc6b740f5dc1dcfac703ad.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:2082829820501672345","tweet_id":"2082829820501672345","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2082829820501672345","title":"@serhii_rieznik I find it relaxing. Been doing it for a year now and finally making almost passable product. Any soldering iron can do it. So all the ","summary":"@serhii_rieznik I find it relaxing. Been doing it for a year now and finally making almost passable product. Any soldering iron can do it. So all the drone builders can hop on board. The Nakat piece was one of the hardest I have tried. Going to order a fancy nib tip soon.","date":"2026-07-30","published":"2026-07-30T14:05:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/serhii_rieznik/status/2082826660101959842","reply_tweet_id":"2082826660101959842","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@serhii_rieznik I find it relaxing. Been doing it for a year now and finally making almost passable product.<br><br>Any soldering iron can do it. So all the drone builders can hop on board.<br><br>The Nakat piece was one of the hardest I have tried.<br><br>Going to order a fancy nib tip soon.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2082829820501672345","display_date":"July 30, 2026 · 14:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
