{"id":"twitter:1716196365628297495","tweet_id":"1716196365628297495","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1716196365628297495","title":"terms of Russian \"New traditionalism: it is usually connected to the literaey works of leksandr Solzhenitsyn and Vasily Belov Just like Forest Gump ru","summary":"terms of Russian \"New traditionalism: it is usually connected to the literaey works of leksandr Solzhenitsyn and Vasily Belov Just like Forest Gump running through the 70's this period in Russian literary analysis is called the \"Long 70's imagine Russian lit..with more words https://t.co/8af9z6AVTN","date":"2023-10-22","published":"2023-10-22T20:54:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1716195179340738818","reply_tweet_id":"1716195179340738818","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>terms of Russian &quot;New traditionalism: it is usually connected to the literaey works of leksandr Solzhenitsyn and Vasily Belov<br><br>Just like Forest Gump running through the 70&#x27;s this period in Russian literary analysis is called the &quot;Long 70&#x27;s<br><br>imagine Russian lit..with more words <a href=\"https://t.co/8af9z6AVTN\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/8af9z6AVTN</a></p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1716196365628297495\">Watch the video in the original tweet</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1716196365628297495","display_date":"October 22, 2023 · 20:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1716195179340738818","tweet_id":"1716195179340738818","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1716195179340738818","title":"In Russian sense traditionalism is more understood as “aesthetics of identity” This art movement emerged in early 1990s -National or values symbols --","summary":"In Russian sense traditionalism is more understood as “aesthetics of identity” This art movement emerged in early 1990s -National or values symbols --respected patterns of behavior, as -defense of higher truths - linear narrative. Norman Rockwell but Russian also Devo album https://t.co/l7R7mFhzAI","date":"2023-10-22","published":"2023-10-22T20:49:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1716192914873663852","reply_tweet_id":"1716192914873663852","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In Russian sense traditionalism is more understood as  “aesthetics of identity”<br><br>This art movement emerged in early 1990s<br>-National or values symbols<br>--respected patterns of behavior, as<br>-defense of higher truths <br>- linear narrative. <br><br>Norman Rockwell but Russian<br><br>also Devo album <a href=\"https://t.co/l7R7mFhzAI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/l7R7mFhzAI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/305dc8c9ace561bb81e831d2b5cd189e.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1716195179340738818","display_date":"October 22, 2023 · 20:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/305dc8c9ace561bb81e831d2b5cd189e.png"]}
