{"id":"twitter:1715530485982543998","tweet_id":"1715530485982543998","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1715530485982543998","title":"@DTWillingham That's a ton of variance to explain away. Though the moderating effect of vocabulary and/or prior knowledge holds. We see it in studies ","summary":"@DTWillingham That's a ton of variance to explain away. Though the moderating effect of vocabulary and/or prior knowledge holds. We see it in studies of online reading comprehension measurement and instruction. That's a hard part, measuring prior knowledge will then pre-teach vocabulary","date":"2023-10-21","published":"2023-10-21T00:48:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1715529887073616200","reply_tweet_id":"1715529887073616200","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DTWillingham That&#x27;s a ton of variance to explain away.<br><br>Though the moderating effect  of vocabulary and/or prior knowledge holds. We see it in studies of online reading comprehension measurement and instruction.<br><br>That&#x27;s a hard part, measuring prior knowledge will then pre-teach vocabulary</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1715530485982543998","display_date":"October 21, 2023 · 00:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
