{"id":"twitter:1713922378634276900","tweet_id":"1713922378634276900","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1713922378634276900","title":"@RacheGabriel reason I carry a ukulele to my reading classes you need zero skills to be a God at that level and anyone can riff a song switching onset","summary":"@RacheGabriel reason I carry a ukulele to my reading classes you need zero skills to be a God at that level and anyone can riff a song switching onsets and rhymes it's almost like the National Reading Panel didn't include any research on music and decoding or something......","date":"2023-10-16","published":"2023-10-16T14:18:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RacheGabriel/status/1713921668098277694","reply_tweet_id":"1713921668098277694","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RacheGabriel reason I carry a ukulele to my reading classes<br><br>you need zero skills to be a God at that level and anyone can riff a song switching onsets and rhymes<br><br>it&#x27;s almost like the National Reading Panel didn&#x27;t include any research on music and decoding or something......</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1713922378634276900","display_date":"October 16, 2023 · 14:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
