{"id":"twitter:1710736860597653946","tweet_id":"1710736860597653946","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1710736860597653946","title":"Never trust any link in DM, even from a friend, sus it out talking to them before click Just assume a DM you didn't ask for wouldn't be from a friend ","summary":"Never trust any link in DM, even from a friend, sus it out talking to them before click Just assume a DM you didn't ask for wouldn't be from a friend and only have a message and a link. And don't accept random DMs. What good has sliding into DMs ever brought you? https://x.com/sleeping_kali/status/1710731012769026380","date":"2023-10-07","published":"2023-10-07T19:20:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Never trust any link in DM, even from a friend, sus it out talking to them before click<br><br>Just assume a DM you didn&#x27;t ask for wouldn&#x27;t be from a friend and only have a message and a link.<br><br>And don&#x27;t accept random DMs. What good has sliding into DMs ever brought you? <a href=\"https://x.com/sleeping_kali/status/1710731012769026380\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/sleeping_kali/status/1710731012769026380</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1710736860597653946","display_date":"October 07, 2023 · 19:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
