{"id":"twitter:1710392051458511360","tweet_id":"1710392051458511360","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1710392051458511360","title":"@AlbionLand1 @ResisterSis20 Majority as Independents. And it is a weird numbers because each state is different. In Connecticut, my state, you can onl","summary":"@AlbionLand1 @ResisterSis20 Majority as Independents. And it is a weird numbers because each state is different. In Connecticut, my state, you can only vote in primary of your party. Others states have open primaries and you don't have to be in the party. So closed primary states have less independents","date":"2023-10-06","published":"2023-10-06T20:30:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1710390973811827141","reply_tweet_id":"1710390973811827141","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AlbionLand1 @ResisterSis20 Majority as Independents.<br><br>And it is a weird numbers because each state is different.<br><br>In Connecticut, my state, you can only vote in primary of your party.<br><br>Others states have open primaries and you don&#x27;t have to be in the party. <br><br>So closed primary states have less independents</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1710392051458511360","display_date":"October 06, 2023 · 20:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
