{"id":"twitter:1708632201921777808","tweet_id":"1708632201921777808","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1708632201921777808","title":"@ladawarranty @Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua It's about risk mana","summary":"@ladawarranty @Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua It's about risk management. A public list of your electric train friends no problem A public list of forgers or fundraisers. It will be targeted. They were targeted I wish it wasn't so, but it is. If a list carries risk, make it p","date":"2023-10-01","published":"2023-10-01T23:57:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ladawarranty/status/1708627937908449343","reply_tweet_id":"1708627937908449343","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ladawarranty @Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua It&#x27;s about risk management.<br><br>A public list of your electric train friends no problem<br><br>A public list of forgers or fundraisers.<br><br>It will be targeted.<br><br>They were targeted<br><br>I wish it wasn&#x27;t so, but it is. <br><br>If a list carries risk, make it private</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1708632201921777808","display_date":"October 01, 2023 · 23:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1708625726075761074","tweet_id":"1708625726075761074","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1708625726075761074","title":"@Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @ladawarranty @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua Yeah I find asking f","summary":"@Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @ladawarranty @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua Yeah I find asking for follows and making recommendations can help. Don't make lists public though. They become attack vectors. Just keep a private list and then on Follow Friday suggest accounts from that list by retweeting and a","date":"2023-10-01","published":"2023-10-01T23:31:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Epifrenetics/status/1708625030232379777","reply_tweet_id":"1708625030232379777","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @ladawarranty @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua Yeah I find asking for follows and making recommendations can help.<br><br>Don&#x27;t make lists public though. They become attack vectors.<br><br>Just keep a private list and then on Follow Friday suggest accounts from that list by retweeting and asking for a follow</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1708625726075761074","display_date":"October 01, 2023 · 23:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1708624373718962532","tweet_id":"1708624373718962532","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1708624373718962532","title":"@Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @ladawarranty @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua But again Follow Fri","summary":"@Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @ladawarranty @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua But again Follow Friday is a tradition that is decades old. Two things can be true. Follow Friday and Follow requests are ineffective Trying to stop follow Friday and follow requests is ineffective. I shared some ideas you folks c","date":"2023-10-01","published":"2023-10-01T23:26:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Epifrenetics/status/1708621513975357472","reply_tweet_id":"1708621513975357472","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Epifrenetics @SteveTownsend0 @DeniseEngle7 @ladawarranty @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua But again Follow Friday is a tradition that is decades old.<br><br>Two things can be true. Follow Friday and Follow requests are ineffective<br><br>Trying to stop follow Friday and follow requests is ineffective.<br><br>I shared some ideas you folks could try, like suggesting accounts on Fridays</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1708624373718962532","display_date":"October 01, 2023 · 23:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
