{"id":"twitter:1708621182847639929","tweet_id":"1708621182847639929","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1708621182847639929","title":"@Epifrenetics @ladawarranty @DeniseEngle7 @SteveTownsend0 @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua And @Epifrenetics my","summary":"@Epifrenetics @ladawarranty @DeniseEngle7 @SteveTownsend0 @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua And @Epifrenetics my feed is messed with and probably deserve it. Been on Tweetdeck for 14 years. Going from 50 chronological feeds to one algorithmic cesspool also sucks. I almost pay Elon. But then I remember why I can't.","date":"2023-10-01","published":"2023-10-01T23:13:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Epifrenetics/status/1708618682778128652","reply_tweet_id":"1708618682778128652","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Epifrenetics @ladawarranty @DeniseEngle7 @SteveTownsend0 @Official_NAFO @Kama_Kamilia @saintjavelin @LibertyUkraineF @U24_gov_ua And @Epifrenetics my feed is messed with and probably deserve it.<br><br>Been on Tweetdeck for 14 years. Going from 50 chronological feeds to one algorithmic cesspool also sucks.<br><br>I almost pay Elon. But then I remember why I can&#x27;t.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1708621182847639929","display_date":"October 01, 2023 · 23:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
