{"id":"twitter:1708206792734331164","tweet_id":"1708206792734331164","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1708206792734331164","title":"@FahCubeItches Yeah it was an article in NDIA that made me learn more. Plus I just like when we see new entries from NATO partners. Ukraine has shown ","summary":"@FahCubeItches Yeah it was an article in NDIA that made me learn more. Plus I just like when we see new entries from NATO partners. Ukraine has shown that the supply chain and export controls need more resiliency and reciprocity. They make perfect sense for loitering drones or delivery.","date":"2023-09-30","published":"2023-09-30T19:46:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FahCubeItches/status/1708205776391520626","reply_tweet_id":"1708205776391520626","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FahCubeItches Yeah it was an article in NDIA that made me learn more.<br><br>Plus I just like when we see new entries from NATO partners.<br><br>Ukraine has shown that the supply chain and export controls need more resiliency and reciprocity.<br><br>They make perfect sense for loitering drones or delivery.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1708206792734331164","display_date":"September 30, 2023 · 19:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
