{"id":"twitter:1707533151520616568","tweet_id":"1707533151520616568","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1707533151520616568","title":"@jfliter @Official_NAFO When I travel to China I go under the asummption any device I have will be compromised. If you can, bring a burner and buy a s","summary":"@jfliter @Official_NAFO When I travel to China I go under the asummption any device I have will be compromised. If you can, bring a burner and buy a sim card there. If you travel with laptop be best if you can wipe it before getting home and letting it on your network. Depends data you have. Risk","date":"2023-09-28","published":"2023-09-28T23:10:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jfliter/status/1707531977300009102","reply_tweet_id":"1707531977300009102","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@jfliter @Official_NAFO When I travel to China I go under the asummption any device I have will be compromised.<br><br>If you can, bring a burner and buy a sim card there.<br><br>If you travel with laptop be best if you can wipe it before getting home and letting it on your network.<br><br>Depends data you have. Risk</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1707533151520616568","display_date":"September 28, 2023 · 23:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
