{"id":"twitter:1707055160164311408","tweet_id":"1707055160164311408","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1707055160164311408","title":"@punkerTan @WJBMass If Jackson Hinkle returns to United States of America and not immediately charged as unregistered Foreign Agent, going to be pisse","summary":"@punkerTan @WJBMass If Jackson Hinkle returns to United States of America and not immediately charged as unregistered Foreign Agent, going to be pissed off Because \"IF\" Jackson is in Russia you can't get that level of Internet access without state consent You can't drive tanks. Shoot artillery","date":"2023-09-27","published":"2023-09-27T15:30:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DikWallace/status/1706721286116745455","reply_tweet_id":"1706721286116745455","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@punkerTan @WJBMass If Jackson Hinkle returns to United States of America and not immediately charged as  unregistered Foreign Agent, going to be pissed off<br><br>Because &quot;IF&quot; Jackson is in Russia you can&#x27;t get that level of Internet access without state consent<br><br>You can&#x27;t drive tanks. Shoot artillery</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1707055160164311408","display_date":"September 27, 2023 · 15:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1707053563292340420","tweet_id":"1707053563292340420","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1707053563292340420","title":"@NAFOWhiteMouse @Twittevitboom @gryn_a @GoddessOfBonk @UEFAcom I 100% percent remember it, but I also remember Sochi and the opening ceremony and it e","summary":"@NAFOWhiteMouse @Twittevitboom @gryn_a @GoddessOfBonk @UEFAcom I 100% percent remember it, but I also remember Sochi and the opening ceremony and it erasing Russian history from Khrushchev on. Like Russia is stuck in 1949 I remember the doping and cheating scandals We shouldn't compete against the Chekist state My opinion. https://t.co/ZXsWIZSUua","date":"2023-09-27","published":"2023-09-27T15:24:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NAFOWhiteMouse/status/1707051970379362353","reply_tweet_id":"1707051970379362353","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NAFOWhiteMouse @Twittevitboom @gryn_a @GoddessOfBonk @UEFAcom I 100% percent remember it, but I also remember Sochi and the opening ceremony and it erasing Russian history from Khrushchev on.<br><br>Like Russia is stuck in 1949<br><br>I remember the doping and cheating scandals<br><br>We shouldn&#x27;t compete against the Chekist state<br><br>My opinion. <a href=\"https://t.co/ZXsWIZSUua\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ZXsWIZSUua</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/2eac6254c4b13ffa05d769f89003ec86.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1707053563292340420","display_date":"September 27, 2023 · 15:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/2eac6254c4b13ffa05d769f89003ec86.jpg"]}
