{"id":"twitter:1706310994463461376","tweet_id":"1706310994463461376","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1706310994463461376","title":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @LPNational In Fact Nick Brana showed up in England as surprise guest week after RATWM See George Galloway","summary":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @LPNational In Fact Nick Brana showed up in England as surprise guest week after RATWM See George Galloway? He organized No2Nato with same people in UK You see links in social network analysis too Look at the RATWM guests..all connected to Russian state media because Libertarian? https://t.co/aUXUoReF4K","date":"2023-09-25","published":"2023-09-25T14:13:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/mykkal/status/1706308212713017705","reply_tweet_id":"1706308212713017705","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @LPNational In Fact Nick Brana showed up in England as surprise guest week after RATWM<br><br>See George Galloway? He organized No2Nato with same people in UK<br><br>You see links in social network analysis too<br><br>Look at the RATWM guests..all connected to Russian state media<br><br>because Libertarian? <a href=\"https://t.co/aUXUoReF4K\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/aUXUoReF4K</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/69185060a65d68250e92dd747b19f0c9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/fbcd3923fe477ab72644219d89c5537c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a054b828e982aada4e16eba0046e52a3.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a4d3796e2eb3363099dda9089e34bc15.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1706310994463461376","