{"id":"twitter:1706309178661175746","tweet_id":"1706309178661175746","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1706309178661175746","title":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @LPNational and @CornelWest I am running to beat Joe Biden because Obama didn't invite me to his party was","summary":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @LPNational and @CornelWest I am running to beat Joe Biden because Obama didn't invite me to his party was first running on Nick Brana's ticket, but realized wait...peoples party isn't a party...then he magically became a Green Party candidate Nothing sus about Jill Stein and Putin, nope https://t.co/6DDwFiFOX4","date":"2023-09-25","published":"2023-09-25T14:06:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1706303364676436324","reply_tweet_id":"1706303364676436324","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @LPNational and @CornelWest I am running to beat Joe Biden because Obama didn&#x27;t invite me to his party<br><br>was first running on Nick Brana&#x27;s ticket, but realized wait...peoples party isn&#x27;t a party...then he magically became a Green Party candidate<br><br>Nothing sus about Jill Stein and Putin, nope <a href=\"https://t.co/6DDwFiFOX4\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/6DDwFiFOX4</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/fb9ad6bbcdf20eba8173d84584fbafbf.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/121ae3871135e77163e4c200c0afe1d9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1706309178661175746","display_date":"September 25, 2023 · 14:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/fb9ad6bbcdf20eba8173d84584fbafbf.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/121ae3871135e77163e4c200c0afe1d9.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1706304825258836462","tweet_id":"1706304825258836462","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1706304825258836462","title":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @TTuberville I didn't know this till now. I really find it interesting. I know lots of people who study Ru","summary":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @TTuberville I didn't know this till now. I really find it interesting. I know lots of people who study Russian troll networks You can't spit into a tidal wave and expect to hold back the energy. Make pretty pictures with your data. Data doesn't even have to be correct if it is pretty.","date":"2023-09-25","published":"2023-09-25T13:49:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/mykkal/status/1706300551741272478","reply_tweet_id":"1706300551741272478","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill @TTuberville I didn&#x27;t know this till now. I really find it interesting. I know lots of people who study Russian troll networks<br><br>You can&#x27;t spit into a tidal wave and expect to hold back the energy.<br><br>Make pretty pictures with your data.<br><br>Data doesn&#x27;t even have to be correct if it is pretty.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1706304825258836462","display_date":"September 25, 2023 · 13:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1706304281287049240","tweet_id":"1706304281287049240","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1706304281287049240","title":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill Find all political reporters in Alabama. Who is on the politics beat? What about defense beat? Cybersecuri","summary":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill Find all political reporters in Alabama. Who is on the politics beat? What about defense beat? Cybersecurity? Go to papers in Alabama, search by topic, identify journalists writing about topics, email them the data Play up the jobs angle. Tubbervile wants to take your job","date":"2023-09-25","published":"2023-09-25T13:46:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/mykkal/status/1706300974929789124","reply_tweet_id":"1706300974929789124","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill Find all political reporters in Alabama. Who is on the politics beat? <br><br>What about defense beat? Cybersecurity? <br><br>Go to papers in Alabama, search by topic, identify journalists writing about topics, email them the data<br><br>Play up the jobs angle. Tubbervile wants to take your job</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1706304281287049240","display_date":"September 25, 2023 · 13:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
