{"id":"twitter:1706298798505353562","tweet_id":"1706298798505353562","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1706298798505353562","title":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill In a way yes, Haven't read Stephen's dissent but you have to remember since 1866 Corporations have been se","summary":"@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill In a way yes, Haven't read Stephen's dissent but you have to remember since 1866 Corporations have been seen as people per 14th amendment. A foreign government just needs to open a 5013-c as a PAC and they have same rights and responsibilities, Illegal under FARA hard to prove","date":"2023-09-25","published":"2023-09-25T13:25:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/mykkal/status/1706297226627022980","reply_tweet_id":"1706297226627022980","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mykkal @Matt_BRnews @osint_69 @RepSherrill In a way yes,<br><br>Haven&#x27;t read Stephen&#x27;s dissent but you have to remember since 1866 Corporations have been seen as people per 14th amendment.<br><br>A foreign government just needs to open a 5013-c as a PAC and they have same rights and responsibilities,<br><br>Illegal under FARA hard to prove</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1706298798505353562","display_date":"September 25, 2023 · 13:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
