{"id":"twitter:1705897749432963464","tweet_id":"1705897749432963464","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705897749432963464","title":"@AvgoustisGeorge @nexta_tv There is no #CrimeaFuelShortage All the Russian occupiers Vacationing in Ukraine will be able to get to Russia . Nothing ha","summary":"@AvgoustisGeorge @nexta_tv There is no #CrimeaFuelShortage All the Russian occupiers Vacationing in Ukraine will be able to get to Russia . Nothing happens to Kerch Bridge... Ever. And land routes in Melitopol will stay open. The petrol stations aren't empty. They are just filled with Russian air https://t.co/tu3TSl1Hii","date":"2023-09-24","published":"2023-09-24T10:51:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Marybethbrmby/status/1705817324782322169","reply_tweet_id":"1705817324782322169","tags":["CrimeaFuelShortage"],"body_html":"<p>@AvgoustisGeorge @nexta_tv There is no #CrimeaFuelShortage<br><br>All the Russian occupiers Vacationing in Ukraine will be able to get to Russia .<br><br>Nothing happens to Kerch Bridge... Ever.<br><br>And land routes in Melitopol will stay open.<br><br>The petrol stations aren&#x27;t empty. They are just filled with Russian air <a href=\"https://t.co/tu3TSl1Hii\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/tu3TSl1Hii</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/6d237248dcfa7d1036dee95f17d8c575.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705897749432963464","display_date":"September 24, 2023 · 10:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/6d237248dcfa7d1036dee95f17d8c575.jpg"]}
