{"id":"twitter:1705705398253023466","tweet_id":"1705705398253023466","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705705398253023466","title":"@DeptOfSusFires @sasdavisk82 What could they be? Remember 75% of all the most vitriolic 2A debates online are from troll accounts. Look at the memes P","summary":"@DeptOfSusFires @sasdavisk82 What could they be? Remember 75% of all the most vitriolic 2A debates online are from troll accounts. Look at the memes Prigozhin's digital terrorists used... So many about guns https://www.justice.gov/d9/press-releases/attachments/2018/10/19/khusyaynova_complaint_003_0.pdf Or race And then we have racist indiscriminate mass shoo","date":"2023-09-23","published":"2023-09-23T22:07:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1705441573725491690","reply_tweet_id":"1705441573725491690","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DeptOfSusFires @sasdavisk82 What could they be?<br><br>Remember 75% of all the most vitriolic 2A debates online are from troll accounts.<br><br>Look at the memes Prigozhin&#x27;s digital terrorists used... So many about guns<br><br><a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/d9/press-releases/attachments/2018/10/19/khusyaynova_complaint_003_0.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.justice.gov/d9/press-releases/attachments/2018/10/19/khusyaynova_complaint_003_0.pdf</a><br><br>Or race<br><br>And then we have racist indiscriminate mass shootings??<br><br>Hmm.. <a href=\"https://t.co/g7Mqp2t3Qg\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/g7Mqp2t3Qg</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b733030c49afd3753e5bf31f368916a1.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d4474b0bb99e1300e89487ab2f3f794f.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/27553abc9bdc5c78a5098be42b825b7c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loadi