{"id":"twitter:1705698995283038341","tweet_id":"1705698995283038341","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705698995283038341","title":"@DemocratDubya @StephanKeevel @PavlosProkopeas @MattPrinciple @Sprinter99800 You misunderstand math. China and India are getting steep discounts. It's","summary":"@DemocratDubya @StephanKeevel @PavlosProkopeas @MattPrinciple @Sprinter99800 You misunderstand math. China and India are getting steep discounts. It's a reverse premium. Why did Russia have to add 20 old school vegetable warehouses because of run away inflation?","date":"2023-09-23","published":"2023-09-23T21:41:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/_TheWhiteLion__/status/1705698498245738652","reply_tweet_id":"1705698498245738652","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DemocratDubya @StephanKeevel @PavlosProkopeas @MattPrinciple @Sprinter99800 You misunderstand math.<br><br>China and India are getting steep discounts.<br><br>It&#x27;s a reverse premium.<br><br>Why did Russia have to add 20 old school vegetable warehouses because of run away inflation?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705698995283038341","display_date":"September 23, 2023 · 21:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
