{"id":"twitter:1705691008057393628","tweet_id":"1705691008057393628","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705691008057393628","title":"@GayLordTheK9 @ninagol15 @ElisabethinCA @Crystalsno @JoeBiden Such a magical bond. It's not so much you training the dog but you learning to listen to","summary":"@GayLordTheK9 @ninagol15 @ElisabethinCA @Crystalsno @JoeBiden Such a magical bond. It's not so much you training the dog but you learning to listen to the full embodied emotions of your partner in order for you both to succeed. Lesson in there somewhere for people.","date":"2023-09-23","published":"2023-09-23T21:10:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/GayLordTheK9/status/1705689419020476805","reply_tweet_id":"1705689419020476805","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GayLordTheK9 @ninagol15 @ElisabethinCA @Crystalsno @JoeBiden Such a magical bond. It&#x27;s not so much you training the dog but you learning to listen to the full embodied emotions of your partner in order for you both to succeed.<br><br>Lesson in there somewhere for people.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705691008057393628","display_date":"September 23, 2023 · 21:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
