{"id":"twitter:1705570667322540346","tweet_id":"1705570667322540346","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705570667322540346","title":"Hey @DucuGavril @EJPointer if you see any of the Russian bots pushing idea that Sandy Hook did not happen or is a conspiracy I encourage folks to bloc","summary":"Hey @DucuGavril @EJPointer if you see any of the Russian bots pushing idea that Sandy Hook did not happen or is a conspiracy I encourage folks to block them. If you feel denial of violent events is reportable people can choose to report this. I find these lies disconcerting https://t.co/UBxKVkovWp","date":"2023-09-23","published":"2023-09-23T13:11:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey @DucuGavril @EJPointer if you see any of the Russian bots pushing idea that Sandy Hook did not happen or is a conspiracy I encourage folks to block them.<br><br>If you feel denial of violent events is reportable people can choose to report this.<br><br>I find these lies disconcerting <a href=\"https://t.co/UBxKVkovWp\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/UBxKVkovWp</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/85365a599a8538119d805edf8858b8b1.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705570667322540346","display_date":"September 23, 2023 · 13:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/85365a599a8538119d805edf8858b8b1.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1705569218110878005","tweet_id":"1705569218110878005","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705569218110878005","title":"@EJPointer @NAFOWhiteMouse @DucuGavril It's slightly different. The advisory roles are a special kind of hire. Three year term. It took some hoops to ","summary":"@EJPointer @NAFOWhiteMouse @DucuGavril It's slightly different. The advisory roles are a special kind of hire. Three year term. It took some hoops to clean house of SES and Advisory Board hires. Luckily most made comments in support of a seditious coup... Shocking Biden administration used those comments to fire","date":"2023-09-23","published":"2023-09-23T13:06:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/EJPointer/status/1705561756330795331","reply_tweet_id":"1705561756330795331","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EJPointer @NAFOWhiteMouse @DucuGavril It&#x27;s slightly different. The advisory roles are a special kind of hire.<br><br>Three year term.<br><br>It took some hoops to clean house of SES and Advisory Board hires. Luckily most made comments in support of a seditious coup... Shocking <br><br>Biden administration used those comments to fire</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705569218110878005","display_date":"September 23, 2023 · 13:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
