{"id":"twitter:1705239508332011836","tweet_id":"1705239508332011836","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705239508332011836","title":"@bluenicks_99 given long production start up costs countries are hesitant to dig into inventory First: -US must authorize ATACMS -Then Germany and Swe","summary":"@bluenicks_99 given long production start up costs countries are hesitant to dig into inventory First: -US must authorize ATACMS -Then Germany and Sweden agree -Then MBDA modifies the Taurus to cut range -Then delivered Taurus never been used in combat. Maybe live action testing be helpful","date":"2023-09-22","published":"2023-09-22T15:15:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705237455232811325","reply_tweet_id":"1705237455232811325","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@bluenicks_99 given long production start up costs countries are hesitant to dig into inventory<br><br>First:<br>-US must authorize ATACMS<br>-Then Germany and Sweden agree<br>-Then MBDA modifies the Taurus to cut range<br>-Then delivered<br><br>Taurus never been used in combat. Maybe live action testing be helpful</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705239508332011836","display_date":"September 22, 2023 · 15:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1705238492563845332","tweet_id":"1705238492563845332","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705238492563845332","title":"@bluenicks_99 and as a side note if folks wondering why everything so mum on ATACMS most of what the public thinks they know is from alleged leaked do","summary":"@bluenicks_99 and as a side note if folks wondering why everything so mum on ATACMS most of what the public thinks they know is from alleged leaked documents in NYT. That means a lot of Fellas, if the work for Gov or even gov contractors, can't really talk about them or even share articles","date":"2023-09-22","published":"2023-09-22T15:11:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705237455232811325","reply_tweet_id":"1705237455232811325","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@bluenicks_99 and as a side note if folks wondering why everything so mum on ATACMS most of what the public thinks they know is from alleged leaked documents in NYT.<br><br>That means a lot of Fellas, if the work for Gov or even gov contractors, can&#x27;t really talk about them or even share articles</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705238492563845332","display_date":"September 22, 2023 · 15:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
