{"id":"twitter:1705035485964349725","tweet_id":"1705035485964349725","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1705035485964349725","title":"@JBelcourt73 @PSprucinski @wask538798 @BasedMikeLee And at the time the US had little in the way of military capability left. Washington was busy usin","summary":"@JBelcourt73 @PSprucinski @wask538798 @BasedMikeLee And at the time the US had little in the way of military capability left. Washington was busy using his armed tax collectors. And at the time the European problem was... Surprise... Russia carving up Poland and Ukraine. I like the short lived Polish Constitution too.","date":"2023-09-22","published":"2023-09-22T01:45:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JBelcourt73/status/1705034269351944404","reply_tweet_id":"1705034269351944404","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JBelcourt73 @PSprucinski @wask538798 @BasedMikeLee And at the time the US had little in the way of military capability left.<br><br>Washington was busy using his armed tax collectors.<br><br>And at the time the European problem was... Surprise... Russia carving up Poland and Ukraine.<br><br>I like the short lived Polish Constitution too.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1705035485964349725","display_date":"September 22, 2023 · 01:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
