{"id":"twitter:1704947698279801238","tweet_id":"1704947698279801238","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1704947698279801238","title":"@Richard_Nelson7 The US is not manipulating Ukraine unless you mean not giving enough arms fast enough. The more support we give Ukraine the faster th","summary":"@Richard_Nelson7 The US is not manipulating Ukraine unless you mean not giving enough arms fast enough. The more support we give Ukraine the faster they can get Russia to leave. Stop blaming anyone but Russia for Russia invading Ukraine. https://t.co/ZVDlQVcQ1c","date":"2023-09-21","published":"2023-09-21T19:56:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Richard_Nelson7/status/1704946926318223662","reply_tweet_id":"1704946926318223662","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Richard_Nelson7 The US is not manipulating Ukraine unless you mean not giving enough arms fast enough.<br><br>The more support we give Ukraine the faster they can get Russia to leave.<br><br>Stop blaming anyone but Russia for Russia invading Ukraine. <a href=\"https://t.co/ZVDlQVcQ1c\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ZVDlQVcQ1c</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/cbb70f8d6e3a49d4b5ecb864c2e87788.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1704947698279801238","display_date":"September 21, 2023 · 19:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/cbb70f8d6e3a49d4b5ecb864c2e87788.jpg"]}
