{"id":"twitter:1703937505182060653","tweet_id":"1703937505182060653","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703937505182060653","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I wrote it silly, it is possible to know and write th","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I wrote it silly, it is possible to know and write things after reading about those things..","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T01:02:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1703936809611243623","reply_tweet_id":"1703936809611243623","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I wrote it silly, it is possible to know and write things after reading about those things..</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703937505182060653","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 01:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703937331244232707","tweet_id":"1703937331244232707","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703937331244232707","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I started with \"If you want me to explain what is wro","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I started with \"If you want me to explain what is wrong with UCR... Itbis really long.... You said explain what is wrong with Black on Black crime\" I told you iy would be long","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T01:01:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1703936089767936200","reply_tweet_id":"1703936089767936200","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I started with &quot;If you want me to explain what is wrong with UCR... Itbis really long.... You said explain what is wrong with Black on Black crime&quot;<br><br>I told you iy would be long</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703937331244232707","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 01:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703936782239191548","tweet_id":"1703936782239191548","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703936782239191548","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Of course not. Neither Dubois,Loury nor Ebony Magazin","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Of course not. Neither Dubois,Loury nor Ebony Magazine suggested there was no work to be done. The problem occurs when people rely on racist excuses to explain away crime rather than lifting up their sleeves to do the work.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:59:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936653604106294","reply_tweet_id":"1703936653604106294","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Of course not. Neither Dubois,Loury  nor Ebony Magazine suggested there was no work to be done. The problem occurs when people rely on racist excuses to explain away crime rather than lifting up their sleeves to do the work.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936782239191548","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703936653604106294","tweet_id":"1703936653604106294","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703936653604106294","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Crime may be up in urban areas as the result of the p","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Crime may be up in urban areas as the result of the pandemic but nowhere near the rates feared in White America. Yet does that mean nothing should be done to stop violent crimes in Black neighborhoods","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:58:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936562034102525","reply_tweet_id":"1703936562034102525","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Crime may be up in urban areas as the result of the pandemic but nowhere near the rates feared in White America. Yet does that mean nothing should be done to stop violent crimes in Black neighborhoods</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936653604106294","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703936562034102525","tweet_id":"1703936562034102525","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703936562034102525","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I mean trying to give White people credit for the Doz","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I mean trying to give White people credit for the Dozens is a stretch. Gun violence in cities are caused by gangs, drug trade, and easy access to guns. Trying to state “Black on Black” crime is about a “beef” is racist . Latzer is using racism to justify a racist","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:58:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936415392800878","reply_tweet_id":"1703936415392800878","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness I mean trying to give White people credit for the Dozens is a stretch.<br><br>Gun violence in  cities are caused by gangs, drug trade, and easy access to guns. Trying to state “Black on Black” crime is about a “beef” is racist . Latzer is using racism to justify a racist contruct</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936562034102525","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703936415392800878","tweet_id":"1703936415392800878","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703936415392800878","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Barry Latzer in the National Review attempted to defe","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Barry Latzer in the National Review attempted to defend the term Black on Black crime. He cited Thomas Sowell and the “black redneck” phenomenon and that African slaves adopted the southern white penchant for violent responses to perceived insults and affronts.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:57:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936291476328902","reply_tweet_id":"1703936291476328902","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Barry Latzer in the National Review attempted to defend the term Black on Black crime. He cited  Thomas Sowell and the “black redneck” phenomenon and that African slaves adopted the southern white penchant for violent responses to perceived insults and affronts.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936415392800878","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703936291476328902","tweet_id":"1703936291476328902","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703936291476328902","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness There is no Black on Black crime. Just as there is no","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness There is no Black on Black crime. Just as there is no white on white crime. There is just crime. When people use the phrase “Black on Black” crime they use it to justify unfair policing practices or to stoke white fear to garner votes with ending the “ American c","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:57:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936136719024496","reply_tweet_id":"1703936136719024496","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness There is no Black on Black crime. Just as there is no white on white crime. There is just crime. When people use the phrase “Black on Black” crime they use it to justify unfair policing practices or to stoke white fear to garner votes with  ending the “ American carnage”</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936291476328902","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703936136719024496","tweet_id":"1703936136719024496","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703936136719024496","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness So crime statistics show only differences exist in vi","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness So crime statistics show only differences exist in violent crime yet Black people are overrepresented in the criminal judicial system regardless of criminal activity","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:56:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935996843164077","reply_tweet_id":"1703935996843164077","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness So crime statistics show only differences exist in violent crime yet Black people are overrepresented in the criminal judicial system regardless of criminal activity</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703936136719024496","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935996843164077","tweet_id":"1703935996843164077","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935996843164077","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In 2010, more than 35% of black men between the ages ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In 2010, more than 35% of black men between the ages of 20 and 39 who did not finish high school were incarcerated—the equivalent number for white men was around 12%, and the number for white men with a college education was close to zero (Natl. Res. Council 2014","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:56:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935878228296075","reply_tweet_id":"1703935878228296075","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In 2010, more than 35% of black men between the ages of 20 and 39 who did not finish high school were incarcerated—the equivalent number for white men was around 12%, and the number for white men with a college education was close to zero (Natl. Res. Council 2014).</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935996843164077","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935878228296075","tweet_id":"1703935878228296075","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935878228296075","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Next we can examine what happens when you throw in ed","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Next we can examine what happens when you throw in education. The chances of a White Man with a college degree seeing prison are zero. A White man without a college degree the chance raises to 12% For Black men between 20 to 39 the chance jumps to 35%","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:55:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935757423874282","reply_tweet_id":"1703935757423874282","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Next we can examine what happens when you throw in education. The chances of a White Man with a college degree seeing prison are zero. A White man without a college degree the chance raises to 12% For Black men between 20 to 39 the chance jumps to 35%</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935878228296075","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935757423874282","tweet_id":"1703935757423874282","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935757423874282","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness If Black people represent 14% of the population and a","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness If Black people represent 14% of the population and almost all crime is equally distributed among white and Black people why see the difference with incarceration rates?","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:55:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935668173303824","reply_tweet_id":"1703935668173303824","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness If Black people represent 14% of the population and almost all crime is equally distributed among white and Black people why see the difference with incarceration rates?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935757423874282","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935668173303824","tweet_id":"1703935668173303824","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935668173303824","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness During the 1990s, African Americans represented only ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness During the 1990s, African Americans represented only 13% of drug users. Yet Black people made up 40% of individuals arrested for drugs. How do we explain this way with “Black on Black crime?","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:54:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935524724212172","reply_tweet_id":"1703935524724212172","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness During the 1990s, African Americans represented only 13% of drug users. Yet Black people made up   40% of individuals arrested for drugs. How do we explain this way with “Black on Black crime?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935668173303824","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935524724212172","tweet_id":"1703935524724212172","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935524724212172","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness It gets worse when we examine prisons. Black men are ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness It gets worse when we examine prisons. Black men are 4 times more likely to be imprisoned than white people (Natl. Res.Council 2014). When you consider race, gender, being between 18-24, and parental income you can predict if someone will see prison time","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:54:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935334956794243","reply_tweet_id":"1703935334956794243","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness It gets worse when we examine prisons.  Black men are 4 times more likely to be imprisoned than white people (Natl. Res.Council 2014). When you consider race, gender, being between 18-24, and parental income you can predict if someone will see prison time</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935524724212172","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935334956794243","tweet_id":"1703935334956794243","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935334956794243","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In fact, latest estimates suggest one in four black m","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In fact, latest estimates suggest one in four black men now have a felony arrest. This begins with children. Puzzanchera & Hockenberry found that In 2013, the arrest rate for black juveniles was 2.4 times higher than white kids","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:53:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935237430902909","reply_tweet_id":"1703935237430902909","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In fact, latest estimates suggest one in four black men now have a felony arrest.  This begins with children. Puzzanchera &amp; Hockenberry found that In 2013, the arrest rate for black juveniles was 2.4 times higher than white kids</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935334956794243","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935237430902909","tweet_id":"1703935237430902909","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935237430902909","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness African Americans are over-represented at every stage","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness African Americans are over-represented at every stage in US criminal justice system. From being searched, frisked, arrested, sentenced to prison or put to death the population of Black men in tlegal system is greater, by massive margins, than their 14% of US Popu","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:53:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935113921257741","reply_tweet_id":"1703935113921257741","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness African Americans are over-represented at every stage in US criminal justice system. From being searched, frisked, arrested, sentenced to prison or put to death the population of Black men in tlegal system is greater, by massive margins, than their 14% of US Population</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935237430902909","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703935113921257741","tweet_id":"1703935113921257741","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703935113921257741","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on black crime is an organized crime problem. N","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on black crime is an organized crime problem. Not a biological defect or even a problem of just zip codes","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:52:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934985080627683","reply_tweet_id":"1703934985080627683","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on black crime is an organized crime problem. Not a biological defect or even a problem of just zip codes</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703935113921257741","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934985080627683","tweet_id":"1703934985080627683","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934985080627683","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness For example In 2006, only 1% of Boston’s population b","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness For example In 2006, only 1% of Boston’s population between the ages of15 and 24 were members of street gangs involved in gun violence. Yet when we ;ppl at gun violence nearly 70% 70% of nonfatal shootings and 50% of fatalities involved gangs (Braga et al. 2008).","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:52:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934868688687343","reply_tweet_id":"1703934868688687343","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness For example  In 2006, only 1% of Boston’s population between the ages of15 and 24 were members of street gangs involved in gun violence. Yet when we ;ppl at gun violence nearly 70%  70% of nonfatal shootings and 50% of fatalities involved gangs (Braga et al. 2008).</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934985080627683","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934868688687343","tweet_id":"1703934868688687343","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934868688687343","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This usually involves gang violence. In almost all vi","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This usually involves gang violence. In almost all violent crimes in Black communities the violence can be traced to street gangs or turf disputes in organized drug crimes","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:51:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934784534114324","reply_tweet_id":"1703934784534114324","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This usually involves gang violence. In almost all violent crimes in Black communities the violence can be traced to street gangs or turf disputes in organized drug crimes</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934868688687343","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934784534114324","tweet_id":"1703934784534114324","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934784534114324","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This concentrated poverty and crime. In America you c","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This concentrated poverty and crime. In America you can not separate poverty, race, and racism. Yet when you dig deeper the violent “black on black” crime is even more concentrated","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:51:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934677671686211","reply_tweet_id":"1703934677671686211","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This  concentrated poverty and crime. In America you can not separate poverty, race, and racism. Yet when you dig deeper the violent “black on black” crime is even more concentrated</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934784534114324","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934677671686211","tweet_id":"1703934677671686211","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934677671686211","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Further loan programs following WWII such as the GI B","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Further loan programs following WWII such as the GI Bill and other mortgage programs were often cut off to Black families. This did not allow institutional family wealth to grow. Thus many people live in housing with absentee landlords and few paths to ownership","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:50:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934577377468607","reply_tweet_id":"1703934577377468607","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Further loan programs following WWII such as the GI Bill and other mortgage programs were often cut off to Black families. This did not allow institutional family wealth to grow. Thus many people live in housing with absentee landlords and few paths to ownership</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934677671686211","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934577377468607","tweet_id":"1703934577377468607","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934577377468607","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In fact when people live below the federal poverty le","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In fact when people live below the federal poverty level it doubles their chances of being a victim of violent crime.Many centuries of slavery, followed by decades of discrimination have concentrated Black people into small urban areas","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:50:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934490047807796","reply_tweet_id":"1703934490047807796","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In fact when people live below the federal poverty level  it doubles their chances of being a victim of violent crime.Many centuries of slavery, followed by decades of discrimination have concentrated Black people into small urban areas</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934577377468607","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934490047807796","tweet_id":"1703934490047807796","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934490047807796","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Economic conditions lead to more crime. This happens ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Economic conditions lead to more crime. This happens regardless of race. Poor Black people and poor white people were found to commit violent crimes at similar rates: 46.4% for white people and 43.4% for Black people.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:50:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934376348733511","reply_tweet_id":"1703934376348733511","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Economic conditions lead to more crime. This happens regardless of race. Poor Black people and poor white people were found to commit violent crimes at similar rates: 46.4% for white people and 43.4% for Black people.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934490047807796","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934376348733511","tweet_id":"1703934376348733511","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934376348733511","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness What about “male on male” crime? Based on the statsti","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness What about “male on male” crime? Based on the statstics that is a massive source of violence. Nobody uses it the phrase to justify the the killing of unarmed Black men. Only Black on Black crime stats get used to stoke white fright for political votes.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:49:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934271067480188","reply_tweet_id":"1703934271067480188","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness What about “male on male” crime? Based on the statstics that is a massive source of violence. Nobody uses it the phrase to justify the the killing of unarmed Black men.<br><br>Only Black on Black crime stats get used to stoke white fright for political votes.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934376348733511","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934271067480188","tweet_id":"1703934271067480188","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934271067480188","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness White on white crime” is just as bad as “Black on Bla","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness White on white crime” is just as bad as “Black on Black crime” because usually a victim knows their assailant. White people know more white people and Black people know more Black people.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:49:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934170454458411","reply_tweet_id":"1703934170454458411","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness White on white crime” is just as bad as “Black on Black crime” because usually a victim knows their assailant. White people know more white people and Black people know more Black people.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934271067480188","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934170454458411","tweet_id":"1703934170454458411","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934170454458411","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on Black crime is often an organized crime prob","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on Black crime is often an organized crime problem and not one rooted in inate biological traits but a pattern of racism that lead to criminality compounded with a fear of the Black Beast.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:48:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934049432015340","reply_tweet_id":"1703934049432015340","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on Black crime is often an organized crime problem and not one rooted in inate biological traits but a pattern of racism that lead to criminality compounded with a fear of the Black Beast.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934170454458411","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703934049432015340","tweet_id":"1703934049432015340","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703934049432015340","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness So if Black people make up 14% of the population, jus","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness So if Black people make up 14% of the population, just like they made up 4% of Philadelphia in 1899 what is the issue?","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:48:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933953541820495","reply_tweet_id":"1703933953541820495","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness So if Black people make up 14% of the population, just like they made up 4% of Philadelphia in 1899 what is the issue?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703934049432015340","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933953541820495","tweet_id":"1703933953541820495","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933953541820495","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness “Black on Black” helps to other crime. Make it deserv","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness “Black on Black” helps to other crime. Make it deserved. Serious but nonfatal violence disproportionately hits black citizens. In 2015, Blacks were 40% more likely than white citizens to be the victims of a rape, robbery, or aggravated assault (Truman & Morgan 20","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:48:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933821320667315","reply_tweet_id":"1703933821320667315","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness “Black on Black” helps to other crime. Make it deserved. Serious but nonfatal violence disproportionately hits black citizens. In 2015, Blacks were 40% more likely than white citizens to be the victims of a rape, robbery, or aggravated assault (Truman &amp; Morgan 2016</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933953541820495","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933821320667315","tweet_id":"1703933821320667315","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933821320667315","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Using the same statistics one could create White on W","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Using the same statistics one could create White on White violent crime statistics but nobody considers the problem of “white crime” In fact based on the same statistics 82% of White people are killed by other white people. The same holds true for victims of crim","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:47:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933710981079396","reply_tweet_id":"1703933710981079396","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Using the same statistics one could create White on White violent crime statistics but nobody considers the problem of “white crime” In fact based on the same statistics 82% of White people are killed by other white people. The same holds true for victims of crime.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933821320667315","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933710981079396","tweet_id":"1703933710981079396","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933710981079396","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Yet dig into the statistics and the vast MAJORITY of ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Yet dig into the statistics and the vast MAJORITY of murders are interacial. In the SMALL number of cases where both the victim and offender are known , 91% of black victims were killed by black offenders","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:47:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933570404823145","reply_tweet_id":"1703933570404823145","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Yet dig into the statistics and the vast MAJORITY of murders are interacial. In the SMALL number of cases where both the victim and offender are known , 91% of black victims were killed by black offenders</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933710981079396","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933570404823145","tweet_id":"1703933570404823145","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933570404823145","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness One people use to justify the negative interactions w","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness One people use to justify the negative interactions with police. In 2015, for example, just over 13% of the US population was black, but when race was known 53% of offenders were black. Over 50% of victims were Black. (US Dep. Justice & Fed. Bureau Investig. 2016","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:46:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933431720051041","reply_tweet_id":"1703933431720051041","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness One people use to justify the negative interactions with  police.  In 2015, for example, just over 13% of the US population was black, but when race was known 53% of offenders were black. Over 50% of victims were Black. (US Dep. Justice &amp; Fed. Bureau Investig. 2016</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933570404823145","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933431720051041","tweet_id":"1703933431720051041","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933431720051041","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness A central tenet in the construct of “black on black” ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness A central tenet in the construct of “black on black” crime requires a difference in Crime. Statistics from the Department of Justice in both 2014 and 2017 suggest there is no difference in crime based on race except for violent crime. A big exception","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:46:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933289759723567","reply_tweet_id":"1703933289759723567","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness A central tenet in the construct of “black on black” crime requires a difference in Crime. Statistics from the Department of Justice in both 2014 and 2017 suggest there is no difference in crime based on race except for violent crime.<br><br>A big exception</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933431720051041","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933289759723567","tweet_id":"1703933289759723567","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933289759723567","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness hip-hop told the story of urban decay and unfair poli","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness hip-hop told the story of urban decay and unfair policing practices during the crack-cocaine epidemics of the 80s. This culminated in the 1994 Crime Bill to protect what Hillary Clinton and Joe Biden both called “Thugs.”","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:45:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933155139346931","reply_tweet_id":"1703933155139346931","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness hip-hop told the story of urban decay and unfair policing practices during the crack-cocaine epidemics of the 80s. This culminated in the 1994 Crime Bill to protect what Hillary Clinton and Joe Biden both called “Thugs.”</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933289759723567","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703933155139346931","tweet_id":"1703933155139346931","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703933155139346931","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness use of statistics of Black Crime would over the next ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness use of statistics of Black Crime would over the next two decades would focus not on causes, but as consequences as a cure. Nixon began the War on Drugs which the Reagan and Bill Clinton administrations doubled down on.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:44:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932798581588162","reply_tweet_id":"1703932798581588162","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness use of statistics of Black Crime would over the next two decades would focus not on causes, but as consequences as a cure. Nixon began the War on Drugs which the Reagan and Bill Clinton administrations doubled down on.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703933155139346931","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932798581588162","tweet_id":"1703932798581588162","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932798581588162","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness We got the UCR, Universal Crime Recording. Even then ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness We got the UCR, Universal Crime Recording. Even then over reporting and over incarceration were evident. Black people get sentenced more frequently and longer since the Great migration in Philadelphia. A trend that continues today","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:43:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932673591271824","reply_tweet_id":"1703932673591271824","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness We got the UCR, Universal Crime Recording. Even then over reporting and over incarceration were evident. Black people get sentenced more frequently and longer since the Great migration in Philadelphia. A trend that continues today</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932798581588162","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932673591271824","tweet_id":"1703932673591271824","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932673591271824","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Prohibition in the 1930s ushered in a new era of crim","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Prohibition in the 1930s ushered in a new era of crime and the FBi. This leads to the Universal Crime Report statistics you collect to show Black people are bad.Criminality is caused by a lack of policing and opportunity not by being Colored","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:43:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932551654445108","reply_tweet_id":"1703932551654445108","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Prohibition in the 1930s ushered in a new era of crime and the FBi. This leads to the Universal Crime Report statistics you collect to show Black people are bad.Criminality is caused by a lack of policing and opportunity not by being Colored</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932673591271824","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932551654445108","tweet_id":"1703932551654445108","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932551654445108","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness When Black people are forced into poverty they are th","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness When Black people are forced into poverty they are thus forced into crime. This created the trend of “Blacks committing more crimes\"","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:42:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932439607820347","reply_tweet_id":"1703932439607820347","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness When Black people are forced into poverty they are thus forced into crime. This created the trend of “Blacks committing more crimes&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932551654445108","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932439607820347","tweet_id":"1703932439607820347","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932439607820347","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Then the depression hit and so many jobs disappeared.","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Then the depression hit and so many jobs disappeared. Poor turn to crime. In 1924 Blacks made up 7% of the population in Philadelphia but 25% of all arrests. Police would use mass arrests in Black communities to make their prevention numbers higher","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:42:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932341846938057","reply_tweet_id":"1703932341846938057","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Then the depression hit and so many jobs disappeared. Poor turn to crime. In 1924 Blacks made up 7% of the population in  Philadelphia but 25% of all arrests. Police would use mass arrests in Black communities to make their prevention numbers higher</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932439607820347","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932341846938057","tweet_id":"1703932341846938057","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932341846938057","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Prison populations began to swell after the Great mig","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Prison populations began to swell after the Great migration. In Cleveland the Balck prison population went from 13% to 60%.Over and over crime statistics were used incorrectly to establish criminality among Black people while little policing was done","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:41:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932217909543359","reply_tweet_id":"1703932217909543359","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Prison populations began to swell after the Great migration. In Cleveland the Balck prison population went from 13% to 60%.Over and over crime statistics were used incorrectly to establish criminality among Black people while little policing was done</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932341846938057","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932217909543359","tweet_id":"1703932217909543359","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932217909543359","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In 1917 and 1918 race riots broke out in Philadelphia","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In 1917 and 1918 race riots broke out in Philadelphia as people blamed Southern migration for their woes. Suddenly Blacks became the target of Vice in Philadelphia. As Migrants pushed into White neighborhoods etnic criminal gangs pushed back","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:41:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932101349847053","reply_tweet_id":"1703932101349847053","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness In 1917 and 1918 race riots broke out in Philadelphia as people blamed Southern migration for their woes. Suddenly Blacks became the target of Vice in Philadelphia. As Migrants pushed into White neighborhoods etnic criminal gangs pushed back</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932217909543359","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703932101349847053","tweet_id":"1703932101349847053","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703932101349847053","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness From around 1912-1917 tension grew as Blacks were den","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness From around 1912-1917 tension grew as Blacks were denied entry into law enforcement and only White neighborhoods saw Vice protection.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:40:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931961973063995","reply_tweet_id":"1703931961973063995","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness From around 1912-1917 tension grew as Blacks were denied entry into law enforcement and only White neighborhoods saw Vice protection.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703932101349847053","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703931961973063995","tweet_id":"1703931961973063995","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703931961973063995","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Instead in Philadelphia saw crime as “countless wrong","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Instead in Philadelphia saw crime as “countless wrong social conditions.” People started to use DuBois to justify their racism like Black on Black crime . In fact DuBois and other fought long and hard to draw attention to crime in Philadelphia","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:40:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931444471460335","reply_tweet_id":"1703931444471460335","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Instead in Philadelphia saw crime as “countless wrong social conditions.” People started to use DuBois to justify their racism like Black on Black crime . In fact DuBois and other fought long and hard to draw attention to crime in Philadelphia</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931961973063995","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703931444471460335","tweet_id":"1703931444471460335","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703931444471460335","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness You have to be careful no to “succumb to vulgar tempt","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness You have to be careful no to “succumb to vulgar temptation” when using Black crime statistics, Dubois notes","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:38:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931351995449603","reply_tweet_id":"1703931351995449603","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness You have to be careful no to “succumb to vulgar temptation” when using Black crime statistics, Dubois notes</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931444471460335","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703931351995449603","tweet_id":"1703931351995449603","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703931351995449603","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black scholars pushed back. Ida B Wells fought agains","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black scholars pushed back. Ida B Wells fought against the racialization of crime and published statistics on lynching in 1890s. She was run out of town. W.E. Duboius did the first statistical analysis on black crimein Philadelphia.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:37:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931205530399088","reply_tweet_id":"1703931205530399088","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black scholars pushed back. Ida B Wells fought against the racialization of crime and published statistics on lynching in 1890s. She was run out of town. W.E. Duboius did the first statistical analysis on black crimein Philadelphia.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931351995449603","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703931205530399088","tweet_id":"1703931205530399088","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703931205530399088","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Hoffman wrote first book on “black crime problem” cal","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Hoffman wrote first book on “black crime problem” called “Race Traits and Tendencies in the American Negro.” in 1896 as an insurance actuary he wrote, “Crime, puaperism, and sexual immorality are without question.” What do you think this did to the ability to get","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:37:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931098156183928","reply_tweet_id":"1703931098156183928","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Hoffman wrote  first book on “black crime problem” called “Race Traits and Tendencies in the American Negro.” in 1896 as an insurance actuary he wrote, “Crime, puaperism, and sexual immorality are without question.” What do you think this did to the ability to get insurance?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931205530399088","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703931098156183928","tweet_id":"1703931098156183928","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703931098156183928","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on Black crime statistics are part of this same","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on Black crime statistics are part of this same effort in an attempt to define the beastality of the Black man with science. You tried to prove Black people are by nature more violent. You need to see the difference","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:36:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930975242055706","reply_tweet_id":"1703930975242055706","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Black on Black crime statistics are part of this same effort in an attempt to define the beastality of the Black man with science. <br><br>You tried to prove Black people are by nature more violent. You need to see the difference</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703931098156183928","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703930975242055706","tweet_id":"1703930975242055706","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703930975242055706","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Bilbo masked the racism in Science writing “that the ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Bilbo masked the racism in Science writing “that the Negro is inferior to the Cuacasian has been proved by six-thousand years of world experimentation” Even the history of the IQ test and the SATs have roots in eugenics.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:36:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930846439256529","reply_tweet_id":"1703930846439256529","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Bilbo masked the racism in Science writing “that the Negro is inferior to the Cuacasian has been proved by six-thousand years of world experimentation”<br><br>Even the history of the IQ test and the SATs have roots in eugenics.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930975242055706","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703930846439256529","tweet_id":"1703930846439256529","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703930846439256529","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Back in the States the field of Eugenics was being us","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Back in the States the field of Eugenics was being used to keep Jim Crow raging. Bilbo, a Senator from Mississippi, was probably the worst. He said, “I call on every red-blodded white man to use any means to keep the n**grs from the polls.”","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:35:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930560849015232","reply_tweet_id":"1703930560849015232","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Back in the States the field of Eugenics was being used to keep Jim Crow raging. Bilbo, a Senator from Mississippi, was probably the worst. He said, “I call on every red-blodded white man to use any means to keep the n**grs from the polls.”</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930846439256529","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703930560849015232","tweet_id":"1703930560849015232","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703930560849015232","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Pearson in his piece “The Problem of Alien Immigratio","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Pearson in his piece “The Problem of Alien Immigration into Great Britain” wrote “the standard of the Jewish aliens in the matter of personal cleanliness is substantially below that of even the poor Gentile children","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:34:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930472827437215","reply_tweet_id":"1703930472827437215","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Pearson  in his piece  “The Problem of Alien Immigration into Great Britain” wrote “the standard of the Jewish aliens in the matter of personal cleanliness is substantially below that of even the poor Gentile children</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930560849015232","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703930472827437215","tweet_id":"1703930472827437215","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703930472827437215","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This was common in eugenics. In the piece “Hereditary","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This was common in eugenics. In the piece “Hereditary Genius”, Galton stated, “the average intellectual standard of the negro race is some two grades below our own”.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:34:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930367072199021","reply_tweet_id":"1703930367072199021","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness This was common in eugenics. In the piece “Hereditary Genius”, Galton stated, “the average intellectual standard of the negro race is some two grades below our own”.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930472827437215","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703930367072199021","tweet_id":"1703930367072199021","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703930367072199021","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Pearson who did much work in correlation studies once","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Pearson who did much work in correlation studies once wrote that, “intelligence can be aided and be trained, but no training or education can create it. You must breed it”. He used statistics to try and prove inferiority","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:33:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930272784204189","reply_tweet_id":"1703930272784204189","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Pearson who did much work in correlation studies once wrote that, “intelligence can be aided and be trained, but no training or education can create it. You must breed it”. He used statistics to try and prove inferiority</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930367072199021","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703930272784204189","tweet_id":"1703930272784204189","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703930272784204189","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Galton, “the father of statistics” used the idea of n","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Galton, “the father of statistics” used the idea of natural selection to form the science of “eugenics” Coining the phrase in 1883","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:33:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930154517479664","reply_tweet_id":"1703930154517479664","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Galton, “the father of statistics” used the idea of natural selection to form the science of “eugenics” Coining the phrase in 1883</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703930272784204189","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
