{"id":"twitter:1703929824660623767","tweet_id":"1703929824660623767","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703929824660623767","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Towards the 1800s the medical field and anthropology ","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Towards the 1800s the medical field and anthropology took up the charge as eugenics began to emerge. Curvier, an anatomy specialist, believed a catastrophic natural event led to the splitting of three races from Eden. He wrote the white race was “the most beautif","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:31:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703929696516206959","reply_tweet_id":"1703929696516206959","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Towards the 1800s the medical field and anthropology took up the charge as eugenics began to emerge. Curvier, an anatomy specialist, believed a catastrophic natural event led to the splitting of three races from Eden. He wrote the white race was “the most beautiful of all.”</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703929824660623767","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703929696516206959","tweet_id":"1703929696516206959","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703929696516206959","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Things got more “scientific” as the Enlightenment con","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Things got more “scientific” as the Enlightenment continued. Lord Kames wrote the polygenesis treatsie “Sketches of the History of Men” which ranked races by four and compared them to dogs. He blamed the climate for the inferiority of Africans.","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:31:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703929566908068133","reply_tweet_id":"1703929566908068133","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness Things got more “scientific” as the Enlightenment continued. Lord Kames wrote the polygenesis treatsie “Sketches of the History of Men” which ranked races by four and compared them to dogs. He blamed the climate for the inferiority of Africans.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703929696516206959","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1703929566908068133","tweet_id":"1703929566908068133","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703929566908068133","title":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness A contemporary of Voltaire, writing under the pen nam","summary":"@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness A contemporary of Voltaire, writing under the pen name distinguished between six races and put Africans at the bottom. He was a monogenesis but noted Africans had “little knowledge.”","date":"2023-09-19","published":"2023-09-19T00:30:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703929448817361326","reply_tweet_id":"1703929448817361326","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PeePeePatriot @SuperealArcDoom @SamariaAsh2003 @HaytDuncanIdaho @WLMCalifornia @iansmithfitness A contemporary of Voltaire, writing under the pen name  distinguished between six races and put Africans at the bottom. He was a monogenesis but noted Africans had “little knowledge.”</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703929566908068133","display_date":"September 19, 2023 · 00:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
