{"id":"twitter:1703359983536984128","tweet_id":"1703359983536984128","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703359983536984128","title":"Just a reminder their is no #CrimeaFuelShortage. Russian tourist on holiday have nothing to worry about. Closed petrol stations just enjoying all the ","summary":"Just a reminder their is no #CrimeaFuelShortage. Russian tourist on holiday have nothing to worry about. Closed petrol stations just enjoying all the pre-planned fireworks displays all over Crimea. Rumors of all routes to Crimea being cut off are lies. Stay in your stolen home https://t.co/YQz91qTtm1","date":"2023-09-17","published":"2023-09-17T10:47:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["CrimeaFuelShortage"],"body_html":"<p>Just a reminder their is no #CrimeaFuelShortage. Russian tourist on holiday have nothing to worry about.<br><br>Closed petrol stations just enjoying all the pre-planned fireworks displays all over Crimea.<br><br>Rumors of all routes to Crimea being cut off are lies.<br><br>Stay in your stolen home <a href=\"https://t.co/YQz91qTtm1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/YQz91qTtm1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/2781405cb9e2472c02ffea671665fc1b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703359983536984128","display_date":"September 17, 2023 · 10:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/2781405cb9e2472c02ffea671665fc1b.jpg"]}
