{"id":"twitter:1703179732244725952","tweet_id":"1703179732244725952","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703179732244725952","title":"@Guardur6 @NealDavidCarr @KentuckyGoddess @KariLake @WandaHaynes @JoeBiden Nah, Just wrong. Plus it's not really our place to decide Ukraine must give","summary":"@Guardur6 @NealDavidCarr @KentuckyGoddess @KariLake @WandaHaynes @JoeBiden Nah, Just wrong. Plus it's not really our place to decide Ukraine must give up. And why should they. Russia'a AD seriously depleted in Ukraine. The Naval Base. And now victories on every axis. Surrender hotline calls up 75% https://t.co/W6159pQGYZ","date":"2023-09-16","published":"2023-09-16T22:51:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Guardur6/status/1703175007986475367","reply_tweet_id":"1703175007986475367","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Guardur6 @NealDavidCarr @KentuckyGoddess @KariLake @WandaHaynes @JoeBiden Nah,<br><br>Just wrong.<br><br>Plus it&#x27;s not really our place to decide Ukraine must give up.<br><br>And why should they. Russia&#x27;a AD seriously depleted in Ukraine.<br><br>The Naval Base. And now victories on every axis. Surrender hotline calls up 75% <a href=\"https://t.co/W6159pQGYZ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/W6159pQGYZ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/20ff0568861e05f77ac855fd7256160b.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703179732244725952","display_date":"September 16, 2023 · 22:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/20ff0568861e05f77ac855fd7256160b.png"]}
