{"id":"twitter:1703081176032834024","tweet_id":"1703081176032834024","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1703081176032834024","title":"@Epifrenetics @LukSGeiworka My feed is garbage. Literal garbage. It has gotten worse. Try using Lists. Ideas -approved PR accounts of units - Add past","summary":"@Epifrenetics @LukSGeiworka My feed is garbage. Literal garbage. It has gotten worse. Try using Lists. Ideas -approved PR accounts of units - Add past donors. 2nd donation is much better signal of converaion. I literally see 2-3 people on my NAFO feed all news aggregators. Everything else is gone.","date":"2023-09-16","published":"2023-09-16T16:19:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Epifrenetics/status/1703079410587336769","reply_tweet_id":"1703079410587336769","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Epifrenetics @LukSGeiworka My feed is garbage. Literal garbage.<br><br>It has gotten worse. Try using Lists.<br><br>Ideas<br>-approved PR accounts of units <br>- Add past donors. 2nd donation is much better signal of converaion.<br><br>I literally see 2-3 people on my NAFO feed all news aggregators.<br><br>Everything else is gone.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1703081176032834024","display_date":"September 16, 2023 · 16:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
