{"id":"twitter:1702832563750863177","tweet_id":"1702832563750863177","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702832563750863177","title":"@chateu21 @FluteMagician @Maipata_ @JoeBiden And the fact that you make that argument as some dude from Arizona is weird. that's entire point. The onl","summary":"@chateu21 @FluteMagician @Maipata_ @JoeBiden And the fact that you make that argument as some dude from Arizona is weird. that's entire point. The only reason ruble looks better in 2023 than 2022 is because March of 22 ruble was at it's lowest. Lost 30% in 2023. You share statistics missing context Need entire picture https://t.co/H4bDsD4wZR","date":"2023-09-15","published":"2023-09-15T23:51:34+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/chateu21/status/1702830779607515428","reply_tweet_id":"1702830779607515428","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@chateu21 @FluteMagician @Maipata_ @JoeBiden And the fact that you make that argument as some dude from Arizona is weird.<br><br> that&#x27;s entire point.<br><br>The only reason ruble looks better in 2023 than 2022 is because March of 22 ruble was at it&#x27;s lowest.<br><br>Lost 30% in 2023.<br><br>You share statistics missing context<br><br>Need entire picture <a href=\"https://t.co/H4bDsD4wZR\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/H4bDsD4wZR</a></p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702832563750863177\">Watch the video in the original tweet</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702832563750863177","display_date":"September 15, 2023 · 23:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
