{"id":"twitter:1702821880309178629","tweet_id":"1702821880309178629","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702821880309178629","title":"@FluteMagician @chateu21 @Maipata_ @JoeBiden And how do we define the ruble being stronger? By that do you mean Robuxs? And I am pretty sure USA is bi","summary":"@FluteMagician @chateu21 @Maipata_ @JoeBiden And how do we define the ruble being stronger? By that do you mean Robuxs? And I am pretty sure USA is biggest energy exporter in US. I'd be happy to reform Jones Act to increase domestic consumption and exports. https://t.co/9h5KwTnjR1","date":"2023-09-15","published":"2023-09-15T23:09:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FluteMagician/status/1702820223567470600","reply_tweet_id":"1702820223567470600","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FluteMagician @chateu21 @Maipata_ @JoeBiden And how do we define the ruble being stronger?<br><br>By that do you mean Robuxs?<br><br>And I am pretty sure USA is biggest energy exporter in US.<br><br>I&#x27;d be happy to reform Jones Act to increase domestic consumption and exports. <a href=\"https://t.co/9h5KwTnjR1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/9h5KwTnjR1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/66bc46ad9d1fb35e0cf4b423af5c6deb.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702821880309178629","display_date":"September 15, 2023 · 23:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/66bc46ad9d1fb35e0cf4b423af5c6deb.jpg"]}
