{"id":"twitter:1702820017471926503","tweet_id":"1702820017471926503","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702820017471926503","title":"@chateu21 @FluteMagician @Maipata_ @JoeBiden @SpeakerPelosi I will toast your stupidity. The Gang of Eight bill failed when. Are you saying we aren't ","summary":"@chateu21 @FluteMagician @Maipata_ @JoeBiden @SpeakerPelosi I will toast your stupidity. The Gang of Eight bill failed when. Are you saying we aren't at almost full employment with Unemployment at record lows. Still don't know what this has to do with Biden supporting a Ukraine free of Russian Imperialism. https://t.co/aqQ5mzXloS","date":"2023-09-15","published":"2023-09-15T23:01:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/chateu21/status/1702818298768044488","reply_tweet_id":"1702818298768044488","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@chateu21 @FluteMagician @Maipata_ @JoeBiden @SpeakerPelosi I will toast your stupidity.<br><br>The Gang of Eight bill failed when.<br><br>Are you saying we aren&#x27;t at almost full employment with Unemployment at record lows.<br><br>Still don&#x27;t know what this has to do with Biden supporting a Ukraine free of  Russian Imperialism. <a href=\"https://t.co/aqQ5mzXloS\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/aqQ5mzXloS</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1e2ce90deb051162ad2b8734fa3b3b9f.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702820017471926503","display_date":"September 15, 2023 · 23:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1e2ce90deb051162ad2b8734fa3b3b9f.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1702815704037175430","tweet_id":"1702815704037175430","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702815704037175430","title":"@FluteMagician @chateu21 @Maipata_ @JoeBiden @SpeakerPelosi And I would fully support comprehensive immigration reform. We have 50 states clamoring fo","summary":"@FluteMagician @chateu21 @Maipata_ @JoeBiden @SpeakerPelosi And I would fully support comprehensive immigration reform. We have 50 states clamoring for workers. And tens of thousands who walk 800+ miles looking for jobs. Sounds like hard workers to me. Not sure what this has to do with Russia's war of terror and genocide in Ukraine https://t.co/6WJwp8zhsm","date":"2023-09-15","published":"2023-09-15T22:44:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FluteMagician/status/1702813849798205858","reply_tweet_id":"1702813849798205858","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FluteMagician @chateu21 @Maipata_ @JoeBiden @SpeakerPelosi And I would fully support comprehensive immigration reform.<br><br>We have 50 states clamoring for workers.<br><br>And tens of thousands who walk 800+ miles looking for jobs.<br><br>Sounds like hard workers to me.<br><br>Not sure what this has to do with Russia&#x27;s war of terror and genocide in Ukraine <a href=\"https://t.co/6WJwp8zhsm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/6WJwp8zhsm</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/01a5cdab0fe3d987b3ac7583e4fc0995.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702815704037175430","display_date":"September 15, 2023 · 22:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/01a5cdab0fe3d987b3ac7583e4fc0995.jpg"]}
